## 2. How to run this on your phone today

### Option A – Super simple, local file

1. Put `index.html` and `halo.js` in the same folder.
2. On your phone, use a file manager to open `index.html` in a browser (Chrome, Firefox, etc.).
3. You now have a local HALO Meta-Oracle app:
   - Set your profile
   - Type a question
   - Hit **“Roll the Meta-Oracle”**
   - It will:
     - Roll d4/d6/d12/d20
     - Map to Axis/Vector/Timeline/Archetype
     - Run Tarot / Runes / I Ching / Numerology / Astro plugins in the background
     - Save everything to localStorage as a chained log

(Depending on your Android/browser combo, you may need a “local HTML viewer” app if Chrome doesn’t like opening [redacted:file-uri] URLs directly.)

### Option B – Host it somewhere & “Add to Home Screen”

